luding policymakers and the public.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG09_TER_015', 'Tertiary education', 'Collaboration and communication', 'Participate in public debates, design challenges and policy dialogues on sustainable development.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG09_ADULT_001', 'Adult education', 'Community mapping and assessment', 'Conduct simple audits of local infrastructure (roads, water access, sanitation, transport).', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG09_ADULT_002', 'Adult education', 'Community mapping and assessment', 'Use basic tools or digital apps (where available) to document gaps and propose improvements.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG09_ADULT_003', 'Adult education', 'Community mapping and assessment', 'Analyse local strengths and resources to support sustainable infrastructure projects.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG09_ADULT_004', 'Adult education', 'Entrepreneurship and local innovation', 'Start or maintain small-scale, sustainable businesses.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG09_ADULT_005', 'Adult education', 'Entrepreneurship and local innovation', 'Develop and use low-cost technologies (for example, compost pits, solar dryers, recycled materials).', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG09_ADULT_006', 'Adult education', 'Entrepreneurship and local innovation', 'Promote local industry that meets community needs while protecting the environment.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG09_ADULT_007', 'Adult education', 'Entrepreneurship and local innovation', 'Practical projects and community action', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG09_ADULT_008', 'Adult education', 'Entrepreneurship and local innovation', 'Organise community clean-up campaigns, recycling programmes or tree-planting initiatives.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG09_ADULT_009', 'Adult education', 'Entrepreneurship and local innovation', 'Build or improve basic infrastructure (for example, irrigation systems, compost toilets, solar lighting).', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG09_ADULT_010', 'Adult education', 'Entrepreneurship and local innovation', 'Plan and take part in local innovation projects (for example,