otection) promote equity and justice.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_SEC_005', 'Secondary education', 'Research and civic engagement', 'Engage in school or community-based service-learning projects that support marginalised or vulnerable groups.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_SEC_006', 'Secondary education', 'Research and civic engagement', 'Apply classroom knowledge to suggest practical strategies for resolving issues of discrimination, marginalisation and environmental justice.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_SEC_007', 'Secondary education', 'Communication and advocacy', 'Articulate informed opinions on topics such as migration, multiculturalism, indigenous rights and economic exploitation.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_SEC_008', 'Secondary education', 'Communication and advocacy', 'Develop advocacy campaigns promoting inclusive policies, respect for diversity and sustainable development.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_SEC_009', 'Secondary education', 'Communication and advocacy', 'Present research or creative work (for example, debates, essays, digital media) to raise awareness about inequality and equity issues locally and globally.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TVET_001', 'TVET', 'Technical and entrepreneurial skills', 'Use digital tools (for example, data analytics platforms, mobile payment apps) to develop inclusive business models.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TVET_002', 'TVET', 'Technical and entrepreneurial skills', 'Apply knowledge to design low-cost solutions for infrastructure, remittance or service delivery in underserved regions.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TVET_003', 'TVET', 'Technical and entrepreneurial skills', 'Learn how to implement technology-driven solutions for economic inclusion, especially in rural or peri-urban areas.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TVET_004', 'TVET', 'Workplace equity and advocacy', 'Respond to inequality in the workplace, promoting inclusive hiring, equal pay and safe working conditions.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TVET_005', 'TVET', 'Workplace equity and advocacy', 'Develop strategies to increase the access of marginalised groups to employment, vocational training and entrepreneurship opportunities.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TVET_006', 'TVET', 'Community engagement and financial services', 'Create or support services that increase access to basic financial products (for example, savings accounts, credit, insurance) for vulnerable groups.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TVET_007', 'TVET', 'Community engagement and financial services', 'Propose ways to extend financial services and infrastructure to communities with limited access, focusing on practical, scalable approaches.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TER_001', 'Tertiary education', 'Research and policy analysis', 'Conduct evidence-based research on global and national inequality trends, including the social and economic impacts on different population groups.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TER_002', 'Tertiary education', 'Research and policy analysis', 'Evaluate mechanisms for the provision and monitoring of social services, including social protection coverage and budget allocation for vulnerable groups.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TER_003', 'Tertiary education', 'Financial innovation and inclusion', 'Design strategies to expand access to responsible, transparent and inclusive financial services – especially for under-represented populations.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TER_004', 'Tertiary education', 'Financial innovation and inclusion', 'Explore the innovative use of ODA and blended finance to strengthen financial leadership and capacity in low-income countries.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TER_005', 'Tertiary education', 'Strategic planning and advocacy', 'Develop frameworks to dismantle structural barriers to equality (for example, discriminatory laws or under-representation in decision-making bodies).', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_TER_006', 'Tertiary education', 'Strategic planning and advocacy', 'Conduct audits of global and national institutions to assess representativeness and accountability in positions of power.', 'Active'), ('CFS_SDG10_ADULT_001', 'Adult education', 'Civic participation and leadership', 'Be able to empower children and youth by developing their confidence, goal setting and aspirations within families and communities.', 'Active') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;